## Critical Conventions
1. preprocess-id matching between DxPreprocess and DxInfer
2. Queue between every processing stage
3. DxRate for RTSP sources
4. Absolute model-path for DxInfer
5. DxMsgConv before DxMsgBroker
6. `logging.getLogger(__name__)` — no `print()`
7. `dxrt-cli -s` before NPU operations

